# No trailing slash: a git worktree usually gets its node_modules as a SYMLINK
# to the main checkout's, and `node_modules/` matches directories only — so the
# symlink was not ignored and `git add -A` committed it (once, for real).
node_modules
dist/
dist-gh/
coverage/
.vite.pid
*.log
.DS_Store
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Raw art inputs (decision A3: re-home, don't police). Concept references,
# pre-pack sprite sources and generator scratch live here and are NOT committed
# — only the packed atlases under src/assets/spritesheets/ are. scripts/pack-sprites.py
# reads this tree; set IBK_ART_DIR to point it somewhere else.
# TODO(eric): src/assets/spritesheets/ar015/ (~114 MB of loco reference frames)
# is still tracked on purpose — it is the in-flight input batch for the loco
# sprite pass. Move it into art/ and drop it from git once that pass lands.
/art/
